:null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-08-19T07:25:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T09:33:11Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T09:32:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue found in: v4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\nStill occurs in: v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\nHas already occured in: v3.6.2.stable.official [3cd3caab6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated Intel(R) Arc(TM) Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.8132) - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 7 155H (22 threads) - 31.43 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs far as I understood the documentation, the int(from: float) constructor should just truncate said float.\nHowever, I found an incredibly specific scenario where this doesn't work. (And I'm assuming that this means there's other scenarios where it breaks as well, which is why I'm reporting this)\n\nIn the attached Screenshot, you will see that I first tested three parts of the final equation, they all work as intended, but then the final one breaks and returns 44 even though it should obviously return 45.\n\n<img width=\"1162\" height=\"576\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43631d15-f2c5-456f-aebc-2f54c9067c3f\" />\n\nI hope this bug isn't too specific, and if it is, I apologize for cluttering your issues page.\n\nThanks!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe easiest way to test this is with\n\nprint(int(1.45-1)*100))\n\nIt will also work if the 1 is a float, so\n\nprint(int(1.45-1.0)*100))\n\nHowever, both 1.45-1 and 1.45*100 will, as seen in the screenshot, will work as intended and return 0.45 and 145 respectively.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust test it with the print() statement described above, it doesnt need anything else...","closed_by":{"login":"Ulliverus","id":191633586,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2wYsg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191633586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus","html_url":"https://github.com/Ulliverus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ulliverus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122580/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}